          {"id":"sh002txt","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p style=\"color:#888;font-size:14px;text-align:right;\">Last Updated: <strong>[DATE]</strong></p>\n<p>We ship all Burans Valley orders across India. Here is everything you need to know.</p>\n<h2>1. Processing Time</h2><p>Orders are processed within <strong>1–2 business days</strong> of payment confirmation (Mon–Sat, excluding public holidays). You will receive a dispatch notification with tracking via email and WhatsApp.</p>\n<h2>2. Delivery Timelines</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;\"><tr style=\"background:#faf7f4;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;text-align:left;\">Zone</th><th style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;text-align:left;\">Estimated Delivery</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Metro cities</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">3–5 business days</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#faf7f4;\"><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Tier 2 &amp; Tier 3 cities</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">5–7 business days</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Remote / hill stations</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">7–10 business days</td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#888;\">Estimates only. Delays may occur due to weather, festive congestion, or logistics disruptions.</p>\n<h2>3. Shipping Charges</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:15px;\"><tr style=\"background:#faf7f4;\"><th style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;text-align:left;\">Order Value</th><th style=\"padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;text-align:left;\">Shipping</th></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Above ₹[FREE SHIPPING THRESHOLD]</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\"><strong>FREE</strong></td></tr><tr style=\"background:#faf7f4;\"><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">Below ₹[FREE SHIPPING THRESHOLD]</td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #e0d5c8;\">₹[SHIPPING CHARGE]</td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:14px;color:#888;\">Exact charges shown at checkout before payment.</p>\n<h2>4. Courier Partners</h2><p>We ship via <strong>[COURIER — e.g. Delhivery / Shiprocket]</strong>. Courier is selected by pin code. We may change courier partners without notice.</p>\n<h2>5. Order Tracking</h2><p>A tracking link is sent to your email and WhatsApp after dispatch. Use the AWB number at <strong>[TRACKING URL]</strong> or the courier's website.</p>\n<h2>6. Failed Delivery</h2><ul><li>Delivery is attempted <strong>twice</strong>.</li><li>After two failed attempts, the package is returned to us (RTO). Re-dispatch may incur a fee.</li><li>Ensure your address, phone, and pin code are correct at checkout. We are not liable for non-delivery due to incorrect details.</li></ul>\n<h2>7. Damaged in Transit</h2><p>If your order arrives damaged, see our <a href=\"/return-refund-policy\" style=\"color:#6b3e26;\">Return &amp; Refund Policy</a> and contact us within 48 hours with photos.</p>\n<h2>8. Non-Serviceable Areas</h2><p>Some remote pin codes may not be serviceable. You will be notified at checkout before payment.</p>\n<h2>9. Questions?</h2><p>Email <strong>[EMAIL]</strong> or WhatsApp <strong>[WHATSAPP]</strong>.</p>","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.8,"sizes":[]}}}
        ]
      }]
